abstract: "Locker provides a web-based graphical user interface (GUI) for users to easily start, use, and stop containers with common data science IDEs such as RStudio and Jupyter. Locker can be used on a local computer or on a remote instance. Locker Services provides an intuitive, web-based portal that can create and manage Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (EC2) instances pre-configured for running Locker."
